{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16232250","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16232250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1623225001:0":{"text":"평소에 온순하던 토끼가 굉장히 격앙된 상태로 칸델에게 한소리를 하고 있었다.","source_cn":"平日温顺的温和的兔子此刻情绪激动，显然正在严厉地指责坎德尔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3C86343DFFE0C7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1623225001":{"text":"평소에 온순하던 토끼가 굉장히 격앙된 상태로 칸델에게 한소리를 하고 있었다.","source_cn":"平日温顺的温和的兔子此刻情绪激动，显然正在严厉地指责坎德尔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3C86343DFFE0C7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1623225002:1":{"text":"저희 굴 옆의 잡초를 전부 다 치워버렸잖아요! 몸을 숨기기 위해서 쓰는 건데, 이래선 숨을 곳도 없어진다고요!","source_cn":"他把我们窝边的杂草都清光了！那些草是我们用来伪装的，现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB318559BD2B0F57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1623225006:1":{"text":"세상에, 바람이 불면 저희 아이들을 데리고 대체 어디로 숨으란 말인가요?","source_cn":"天哪，这下一有风吹草动，我和孩子们往哪儿躲？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE73672F76323F1F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1623225007:0":{"text":"엄마, 그게 아니라... 칸델 씨는 좋은 마음으로...","source_cn":"妈妈，不是这样的，坎德尔先生他是好心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA7E272C7A35D806","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1623225008:0":{"text":"우리 딸, 왜 나왔니? 여긴 엄마가 해결할 테니까 너는 가서 동생들을 좀 봐주렴.","source_cn":"孩子……你怎么出来了？妈妈在处理事情，你先回去照顾弟弟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x156E8E58F6534805","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1623225009:1":{"text":"그게 아니라...","source_cn":"可是……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3AE3B19634F0CCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1623225010:1":{"text":"무언가를 설명하려던 아기 토끼는 엄마에게 떠밀려 다시 굴속으로 돌아갔다.","source_cn":"小兔子还想解释什么，却被妈妈轻轻推着带回了窝里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB15F176AEB839A11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1623225011:0":{"text":"대체 저희에게 얼마나 큰 피해를 줬는지 알고는 있어요?","source_cn":"你知道你给我们添了多大的麻烦吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42B7351A9E7E4F04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1623225012:1":{"text":"저는 정말로... 도와드리고 싶어서...","source_cn":"我……我只是想帮帮你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8719665F29AEC221","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","